{"last_link_id": 1, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#363636", "widgets_values": ["# steps (步数)\n这就像你挥动魔法棒的次数，或者画家绘画的精细程度。步数越多，AI 绘制的就越细致，图像质量通常也会更好，但花费的时间也会更长。\n\n现实例子： 画一幅简单的速写可能只需要几步，而画一幅精细的油画则需要无数次的涂抹和调整。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#222222", "size": [500, 190], "pos": [-300, 390], "id": 9, "properties": {}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#363636", "widgets_values": ["# cfg (尺度)\n\ncfg: Classifier Free Guidance\n\n这个参数控制 AI 在多大程度上遵循你的正面提示词。数值越高，AI 就越会努力按照你的正面提示词来生成图像，但过高可能会导致图像失真或不自然。\n\n现实例子： 你给画家提建议的程度。如果你的建议很强烈（高 CFG），画家就会非常努力地按照你的想法来画；如果你的建议很随意（低 CFG），画家可能会有更多的自由发挥空间。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#222222", "size": [500, 220], "pos": [-300, 617.5], "id": 13, "properties": {}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#363636", "widgets_values": ["# sampler_name (采样器名称)\n这就是你选择的具体“绘画技巧”（上面输入端的 sampler 只是一个连接）。不同的采样器有不同的特点，有些速度快，有些细节好，有些擅长特定风格。\n\n现实例子： 就像选择不同的画笔类型，比如细尖笔用于勾勒细节，粗毛刷用于大面积涂色。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#222222", "size": [500, 190], "pos": [-300, 875], "id": 10, "properties": {}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#363636", "widgets_values": ["# scheduler (调度器)\n这个参数与采样器配合使用，控制在每个“绘画步骤”中如何添加和去除噪点。不同的调度器会影响图像的生成速度和最终效果。初学者可以先使用默认设置，后续再深入了解。\n\n现实例子： 就像画家在绘画过程中调整颜料的浓稠度和涂抹的方式。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#222222", "size": [500, 190], "pos": [-300, 1102.5], "id": 12, "properties": {}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#363636", "widgets_values": ["# sampler_name (采样器)\n这就像你选择的具体的绘画技巧或风格。不同的采样器（比如 Euler a、LMS、DPM++）会以不同的方式“绘制”图像，影响最终的细节、速度和风格。\n\n现实例子： 就像你选择用细腻的笔触还是粗犷的笔刷来画画，不同的采样器会带来不同的绘画风格。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#222222", "size": [500, 170], "pos": [-300, 182.5], "id": 6, "properties": {}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#363636", "widgets_values": ["# latent_image (潜在图像)\n有时候你不想从完全随机的噪点开始，而是想在已有的基础上进行修改或生成。这个输入就允许你连接一个已有的“潜在图像”（一种AI理解的图像信息）。如果第一次生成，通常会连接 \"Empty Latent Image\"。\n\n现实例子： 就像你在一张已经画了草稿的画布上继续上色和细化。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#222222", "size": [500, 180], "pos": [-300, -35], "id": 5, "properties": {}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#363636", "widgets_values": ["# denoise (去噪)\n这个参数通常用于图像修复或图像到图像的生成。对于从纯噪点开始的文生图，通常设置为 1，表示完全从噪点开始生成。如果你想在已有的图像基础上进行修改，可以降低这个值。\n\n现实例子： 如果你在一张画了一半的画上继续修改，你只需要“去噪”一部分，而不是从一张完全空白的画布开始。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#222222", "size": [500, 190], "pos": [-300, 1330], "id": 11, "properties": {}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#fff0", "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "type": "Label (rgthree)", "title": "EricXu@DragonAI", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#fff0", "size": [163.701171875, 20], "pos": [-290, -920], "id": 17, "properties": {"padding": 0, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fontFamily": "Arial", "borderRadius": 0, "textAlign": "left", "fontSize": 20, "fontColor": "#00FF00"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#363636", "widgets_values": ["# model (模型)\n这就像你选择的“颜料”和“画笔”的组合。不同的模型（比如 SDXL、Stable Diffusion 1.5）擅长画出不同风格的画作。你需要先用“Load Checkpoint”节点加载一个模型，然后把它的“model”输出连接到 KSample 的这个“颜料画笔”入口。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#222222", "size": [500, 150], "pos": [-300, -530], "id": 3, "properties": {}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#fff0", "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "type": "Label (rgthree)", "title": "Output", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#fff0", "size": [120.078125, 40], "pos": [1010, -630], "id": 20, "properties": {"padding": 0, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fontFamily": "Arial", "borderRadius": 0, "textAlign": "left", "fontSize": 40, "fontColor": "#00FFFF"}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#fff0", "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "type": "Label (rgthree)", "title": "Input", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#fff0", "size": [88.96484375, 40], "pos": [-300, -630], "id": 19, "properties": {"padding": 0, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fontFamily": "Arial", "borderRadius": 0, "textAlign": "left", "fontSize": 40, "fontColor": "#00FFFF"}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#fff0", "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "type": "Label (rgthree)", "title": "Processing", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#fff0", "size": [197.87109375, 40], "pos": [300, -630], "id": 21, "properties": {"padding": 0, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fontFamily": "Arial", "borderRadius": 0, "textAlign": "left", "fontSize": 40, "fontColor": "#00FFFF"}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#fff0", "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "type": "Label (rgthree)", "title": "KSampler Node", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#fff0", "size": [705.908203125, 100], "pos": [-290, -1040], "id": 16, "properties": {"padding": 0, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fontFamily": "Arial", "borderRadius": 0, "textAlign": "left", "fontSize": 100, "fontColor": "#ffffff"}, "order": 12}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#363636", "widgets_values": ["# positive (正面提示词)\n这就是你告诉 AI 你想要画什么的核心文字描述！越清晰、越详细，AI 就越明白你的意图。\n\n现实例子： “画一个阳光明媚的海滩，有白色的沙滩、蓝色的海水和绿色的椰子树。”\n\n# negative (负面提示词)\n这就是你告诉 AI 你不想要画什么。它可以帮助去除你不希望出现的瑕疵或风格。\n\n现实例子： “不要画模糊的细节，不要出现扭曲的人体，不要有文字水印。”"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#222222", "size": [500, 270], "pos": [-300, -342.5], "id": 7, "properties": {}, "order": 13}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#fff0", "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "type": "Label (rgthree)", "title": "Thinking In ComfyUI", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#fff0", "size": [362.34375, 40], "pos": [-290, -1100], "id": 14, "properties": {"padding": 0, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fontFamily": "Arial", "borderRadius": 0, "textAlign": "left", "fontSize": 40, "fontColor": "#FFFF00"}, "order": 14}, {"outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "LATENT"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": [448889071056145, "randomize", 20, 8, "euler", "normal", 1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"name": "positive", "label": "positive", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "positive"}, {"name": "negative", "label": "negative", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "negative"}, {"name": "latent_image", "label": "latent_image", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "latent_image"}], "flags": {}, "type": "KSampler", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [600, 262], "pos": [300, -530], "id": 1, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.28", "Node name for S&R": "KSampler"}, "order": 15}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#363636", "widgets_values": ["# noise (噪点)\nnoise 是 Stable Diffusion 生成图像的基石和起点。它的随机性赋予了模型创造力，而模型的核心任务就是学习如何从这个随机的 noise 中提取出符合用户指令的清晰图像。KSampler 节点正是控制这个从 noise 到图像的“雕刻”过程的关键工具。\n\n这就像你开始绘画时，画布上随机分布的一些小点点。KSample 节点会从这些随机的“噪点”开始，根据你的文字提示，一点点地去除“不该有的点点”，留下“该有的颜色和形状”，最终形成图像。\n\n现实例子： 想象一下电视信号不好时的雪花点。KSample 就是从这些“雪花点”开始，引导它们变成有意义的图像。通常你会用 \"Empty Latent Image\" 节点创建一个空白的“噪点画布”。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#222222", "size": [600, 240], "pos": [300, -220], "id": 4, "properties": {}, "order": 16}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#363636", "widgets_values": ["# KSample 的处理过程\n\nKSample 对噪点的处理是一个迭代的去噪过程：\n\n- 开始时，noise 输入提供了一个随机的潜在空间表示，充满了随机性（噪点）。\n- 在每个采样步骤中，KSample 会预测应该从当前的噪点状态中去除哪些部分，才能更接近你的目标图像。 这个预测是基于你提供的模型和条件（提示词）。\n- 调度器 (scheduler) 控制着如何以及多少噪声被去除，以及如何在每一步中引入新的、更符合提示词的信息。\n- 经过你设定的“步数 (steps)” 后，原始的随机噪点会逐渐被“雕刻”成一个与你的提示词高度相关的潜在空间表示。\n- 最终，这个“雕刻”好的潜在空间表示会通过 VAE Decode 节点“翻译”成我们能看到的清晰图像，那些最初的“噪点小精灵”已经变成了美丽的画卷！\n\n所以，简单来说，KSample 就是一个**“噪点净化器”和“图像塑造者”**。它以随机的噪点为起点，通过一系列精细的步骤，根据你的文字指令，一点点地去除“坏噪点”，留下“好噪点”，最终生成你想要的图像。而不同的参数则控制着这个“净化”和“塑造”的具体方式和强度。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#222222", "size": [600, 470], "pos": [300, 60], "id": 15, "properties": {}, "order": 17}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#363636", "widgets_values": ["### latent (潜在，潜空间)\n这是最终生成的“潜在图像”。你通常需要将它连接到 \"VAE Decode\" 节点，才能将其转换成我们肉眼可见的普通图像格式。\n\n现实例子： 这就像你画完的草稿，还需要经过一道“翻译”才能变成真正的彩色画作。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#222222", "size": [500, 140], "pos": [1010, -530], "id": 8, "properties": {}, "order": 18}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#363636", "widgets_values": ["# KSample 节点\n就是你工作室里最核心的那根魔法棒！它的作用就是将你输入的文字描述（提示词）变成一张你想要的图像。\n\n简单来说，你告诉 KSample 节点你想要画什么（通过文字），它就会挥动“魔法”，一点一点地“绘制”出图像。这个“绘制”的过程就叫做采样 (Sampling)。\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#222222", "size": [1800, 140], "pos": [-300, -840], "id": 2, "properties": {}, "order": 19}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#fff0", "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "type": "Label (rgthree)", "title": "Level 100", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#fff0", "size": [86.73828125, 20], "pos": [1410, -920], "id": 22, "properties": {"padding": 0, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fontFamily": "Arial", "borderRadius": 0, "textAlign": "left", "fontSize": 20, "fontColor": "#00FF00"}, "order": 20}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [1], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [303.3431396484375, 326], "pos": [301.7293395996094, 1599.483642578125], "widgets_values": ["example.png", "image", ""], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 23, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 21}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [282.0564880371094, 324.58880615234375], "pos": [623.0552368164062, 1602.524658203125], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI", ""], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 1, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "flags": {}, "id": 24, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 22}], "extra": {"ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [347.0138639469304, 1203.8081134515182], "scale": 0.724729500000001}}, "groups": [], "links": [[1, 23, 0, 24, 0, "IMAGE"]], "id": "3a87da35-0f13-4c6a-8b41-dcc54527a151", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 24, "revision": 0}